3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"range\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Range</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"atk_mod\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Atk Modifier</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hit_mod\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Hit% Modifier</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">+2</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Weapons<br/>Distance Weapons<br/>Bows</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">52.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">25,000+ gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">25,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.20<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20080620211236&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Composite_Hornbow_834b9c.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a composite hornbow <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Range:6, Atk+2, Hit%+2)</span>.<br/>Imbuements: (Empty Slot, Empty Slot, Empty Slot).<br/>Classification: 2 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by paladins of level 50 or higher.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 52.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This <a href=\"#/wiki/Bow\">bow</a> is almost the same as the <a href=\"#/wiki/Arbalest\">arbalest</a>, but it has 1 more attack. Combined with <a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Arrow\">Onyx Arrows</a> it has 1 less attack than the <a href=\"#/wiki/Arbalest\">arbalest</a> with <a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Bolt\">power bolts</a>. Contrary to popular belief, a Composite Hornbow combined with onyx arrows actually hits higher on average than an Arbalest with power bolts. The average damage inflicted by a level 100 paladin with 100 distance using a Composite Hornbow and onyx arrows is 193, whereas the average damage inflicted by the same paladin using an Arbalest and power bolts is 192. This is due to the higher hit percentage of the Hornbow(they both have 2% hit, only difference is +1 atk on Hornbow, need an updated source on this).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-object-proficiency\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Weapon_Proficiency\">Weapon Proficiency</span></h3>\n<div class=\"weapon_proficiency weapon_proficiency_border\">\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_number_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"weapon_proficiency_table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Attack Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1 attack</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Auto-Attack Critical Extra Damage\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+10% critical extra damage for auto-attacks</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Ranged Hit Chance\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1% hit chance</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapo